# Filled-in answers files NEVER belong here - the repo is public.
# aigov/answers.py refuses to read one from inside the tree; this is belt-and-braces.
answers*.toml
*answers*.toml

# Season-two privacy rail: the live sensor-site config (coordinates) is OFF-REPO by design.
# The repo records the site as a SHAPE only ("a reachable sensor site"). See
# docs/idea-anchor-prompt-farm-season-two-2026-10-27.md + aigov/farm_site_config.py.
local/

# Generated docx of the season report stays untracked by design (user decision 2026-10-27)
